extends shell

block content
  .admin-page
    h1 Staff
    p.admin-lede #{team} accounts have back office access. You are signed in as #{me.name}.
    p A staff account is created from the console, not from here:
    p
      code.secret bun run add-staff "Name" name@nashluxuryrealty.house
    p.note There is no route on this site that can create one, so a defect in a public form cannot mint a reviewer.
